Project Guardrails:

Stack: Kotlin Multiplatform (KMP), Jetpack Compose / Compose Multiplatform.

Architecture: Strict Clean Architecture (Domain, Data, Presentation).

Pattern: MVVM with StateFlow for UI state.

Concurrency: Kotlin Coroutines & Flow.

Rule 1: All business logic (e.g., streak calculation) must live in the shared module within Use Cases.

Rule 2: ViewModels must expose a single UiState via StateFlow.

Rule 3: Repositories must handle data mapping between DataSources and Domain Entities.

Rule 4: No platform-specific code in the commonMain logic unless using expect/actual.